Setup Instructions
1. Clone this repository:
   git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/smart-city-infrastructure.git
2. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   npm install
3. Configure environment variables (.env):
   MONGO_URI=<your-mongodb-uri>
   ETH_NODE_URL=<your-ethereum-node>
   AWS_KEY=<your-aws-key>
4. Start backend services:
   npm start
   python app.py
5. Launch Node-RED dashboard and connect MQTT data streams.
